{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111528","id":2907035475,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tRddT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111528/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111528/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111528/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d1ed959e9d79899c38908e63095092fc46837a52","number":111528,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Depict version discrepancies in Project Manager","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13350 .\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an icon next to each project's version number in the Project Manager if the project's version is different from the Project Manager version.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82f5b3bd-ac63-4a1e-a5fa-8150d19952bb\r\n\r\nIf a project uses an *older* version of Godot than the PM's version, it will show an up arrow, indicating that opening the project will upgrade it. Conversely, if the project's version is *newer* than the PM's version, a down arrow will indicate it will be downgraded. If the project version matches the PM version, no icon is displayed.\r\n\r\nOther unsupported project features remain attached to the existing ⚠️ icon.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI chose the current up and down icons since they already existed in Godot and can be interpreted as \"upgrade\" and \"downgrade\" fairly easily. However, I do wish they stood out more (especially \"downgrade\" being a dangerous action, as it is right now with the ⚠️ symbol); perhaps we can find or come up with a better icon to indicate this.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gi